        <mxCell id="annot_card_encrypt" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EBF3F0;strokeColor=#4E877B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#133D37;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. WHAT DOES ENCRYPTION (AES-256-GCM) DO?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• 2-way reversible scrambling of plaintext into unreadable Ciphertext via random 256-bit DEK.&lt;br/&gt;• Purpose: Absolute confidentiality. Only holders of the valid DEK key can decrypt.&lt;br/&gt;• DEK key is wrapped by Master KEK and split via Shamir SSS (2/3)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="455" x="535" y="1545" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="annot_card_r2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F4FA;strokeColor=#7188B5;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#1A2D4E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. WHAT DOES CLOUDFLARE R2 STORE?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• STORES ONLY CIPHERTEXT (.enc)! Binary blob format (application/octet-stream).&lt;br/&gt;• Zero plaintext files, zero encryption keys, zero identity metadata.&lt;br/&gt;• Even if R2 is compromised, attackers obtain 0-bit usable info. Zero-Egress $0 fees." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="92" width="455" x="1010" y="1545" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="annot_card_db" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAF5EB;strokeColor=#B5955E;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#4A3816;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. WHAT DOES DATABASE (POSTGRESQL) STORE?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• STORES ONLY NON-SECRET METADATA &amp;amp; WRAPPED KEYS (NO plain secrets in DB):&lt;br/&gt;  AssetId, Title, SizeBytes, Checksum SHA-256, StorageKey, Nonce 12B, Tag 16B,&lt;br/&gt;  WrappedDataKeyBase64 (80 chars), and Shamir Share 1. (Share 2 is kept by Client)." vertex="1">
